"B button item id\" — writing 0 set it to \"none\", so pressing B might do nothing. Hmm! Baseline 0x0664=7. If 0x0664 is the B item, setting it to 0 removed the item. Let me first restore 0x0664=7 (load_state 0 again) before testing B.\n\nHmm, alternatively 0x0664 is the \"sword\" flag. Ugh.\n\nLet me reload state 0 (clean: 0x66E=3, 0x658=7, 0x664=7, 0x66F=2, 0x670=2, 0x66D=11) and press","truncated":true}
